<v Sandy Tolan>And so it goes throughout the evening. Jill and I walk into a go-go bar. Jill goes backstage and dancers speculates on what might have happened to Susan. Maybe it was the Russian mob. Maybe it was the regular mob. Maybe it was a deranged go-go patron. Maybe somebody was mad at something she said in the book Red Light.
<v Sandy Tolan>夜晚就这样过去了。吉尔和我走进一家舞厅。吉尔去后台，舞女们猜测苏珊可能发生了什么事。也许是俄罗斯黑手党干的。也许是普通黑手党。也许是一个疯狂的舞厅顾客。也许有人对她在《红灯》书中所写的内容感到愤怒。

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:14.530
<v Woman 2>It could have been anything.
